# INVWINHC.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: the help window
# that stands in for Windows Help, as its run has no BIN/INVWIN.HLP (the
# run of INVWINWH.KEY has).  F1 in the login dialog shows LOGIN, and F1
# in the help the keys in its place; ENTER closes it, and SHIFT-F1 and
# CTRL-F1 then show no help.  On the item list F1 shows ITEMS, in the
# item form ITEM, each closed by ESC; Help > Help on this screen shows
# the list's, Help > Getting started its first steps, Help > Keyboard
# the keys, and Help > About VER's text.  The end by Exit.
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINHC.SNP is its snapshot.
K F1
S LOGIN
K F1
S KEYS
K ENTER SHIFT-F1 CTRL-F1
S BACK
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER F1
S ITEMS
K ESC ENTER F1
S ITEM
K ESC ESC ALT-H H
S SCREEN
K ESC ALT-H G
S START
K ESC ALT-H K
S KEYBOARD
K ESC ALT-H A
S ABOUT
K ENTER ALT-F X
